  <name>Timezones</name>
  <summary>World time clocks with native GTK4 UI</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Keep track of the time in the cities that matter to you. Timezones shows a
      row per city on a shared timeline, so a glance tells you who is asleep, who
      is at work, and what an hour of your day looks like everywhere at once.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Scrub the timeline to read the same moment in every city</li>
      <li>Daylight shading, so working hours and the middle of the night are obvious</li>
      <li>Pick any date to plan ahead across daylight saving changes</li>
      <li>Share a time as a calendar invitation or as text</li>
      <li>12- or 24-hour clocks, light and dark themes</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

